 🐳 Task 7: Dockerizing the Application

 🎯 Objective
Containerize the Hello World application using Docker.

 🧩 Steps I Performed
1. Created a Dockerfile in the repo root  
2. Built the Docker image: `docker build -t hello-world-app .`  
3. Ran the container to verify output: `docker run --rm hello-world-app`  

